## 2. Data Collection

### Server Logs

Our hosting provider (Vercel) automatically collects information in server log files: browser type/version, operating system, referrer URL, hostname, and time of the request.

### Newsletter

When you subscribe to our newsletter or enter a competition (first name, last name, email), your data is processed on the basis of your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) to send the newsletter and run the competition. For this purpose it may be shared with our processors, in particular **MailerLite** (storage and management of contacts) and **VirtualZoom** (newsletter delivery), under concluded data-processing agreements. Where a processor is established outside the European Economic Area, transfers take place only with appropriate safeguards under the GDPR (in particular the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses). Data is kept until consent is withdrawn; you can unsubscribe and withdraw consent free of charge at any time.

## 3. Cookies and Analytics

This website uses **no tracking cookies**. We use **Plausible Analytics**, a privacy-friendly analytics tool that sets no cookies, collects no personal data, and is fully GDPR compliant.

## 4. Third-Party Services

- **OpenStreetMap** — interactive destination map (Leaflet.js)
- **Plausible Analytics** — cookie-free web analytics

No data is transmitted to Google, Facebook, or other advertising networks.

## 5. Your Rights

You have the right to access, rectify, delete, restrict the processing of, and port your personal data, to object to processing, and — where processing is based on consent — to withdraw consent at any time (withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing before withdrawal). Contact: [webmaster.cz@ensanahotels.com](mailto:webmaster.cz@ensanahotels.com).

You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority — Úřad pro ochranu osobních údajů (Czech Data Protection Authority), Pplk. Sochora 27, 170 00 Prague 7, [www.uoou.cz](https://www.uoou.cz).

The detailed Ensana Group privacy policy, setting out all the details, is available at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/about-ensana/privacy-cookie-policy).

## 6. Hosting

This website is hosted by Vercel Inc. (Region: Frankfurt, EU).
